   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The more...",
     "texto": [
      "Чем + comparative, тем + comparative: Чем больше, тем лучше («The more, the better»). Separate the two parts of the construction with a comma.",
      "The comma goes between the two parts: Чем больше я читаю, тем быстрее понимаю («The more I read, the faster I understand»). A comma is not automatically placed right after чем."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Not only... but also...",
     "texto": [
      "**Не только... но и...** («not only... but also...»): **Он не только умный, но и добрый** («He is not only clever but also kind»). **Но и** is a single unit: it is not separated."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
